    skos:definition "Occult martial arts and medicine operate by trying to influence Chi or Ki, and visualization is finding its place in the treatment of disease."@en ;
    skos:note "The work states what these arts try to do and that occidental medicine has begun to use visualization; it gives no result of its own."@en ;
