pmc:ChaosMagicSubliminalReading a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "The subliminal reading of memory, letting the subconscious act without conscious interference"@en, "Das unterschwellige Lesen des Gedächtnisses, das das Unbewusste ohne bewusste Störung wirken lässt"@de ;
    skos:definition "The contents of memory only appear to emit or couple with etheric patterns when being read, consciously or subliminally, presumably because memory is encoded in highly abstract and idiosyncratic ways. The subliminal mode of reading memory is invariably the most magically effective, as the information is not then complicated and adulterated with conscious deliberation."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChaosMagic ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:LiberKaos ;
    dcterms:source "Carroll, Liber Kaos (Boston and York Beach: Weiser Books; first published 1992, printing of 2003), Liber Kaos, ch. 1 Principia Magica, Quantum Metaphysics, p. 28; read in a full-text layer whose running heads carry the page" .

