    rdfs:label "Artificial ghosts with effects as good as, and often better than, the supposedly real"@en, "Künstliche Geister mit Wirkungen so gut wie die der angeblich echten und oft besser"@de ;
    skos:definition "Artificial ghosts of persons who never existed, which can create effects as good as, and often better than, those ascribed to the supposedly real thing."@en ;
